# Cameras

## Overview
This page will contain the following sections:
    - left panel: will contain the list of cameras
      - camera name
    - right panel: will contain the details of the camera
      - current live feed
      - resize options
      - mirror options
      - flip options
      - perspective transform tools
        - a popup will open to select the 4 points of the perspective transform
        - the points will be displayed on the camera feed as clicked.
        - a button to apply the perspective transform will be displayed
        - a button to reset the perspective transform will be displayed
        - a button to save the perspective transform will be displayed